      "C": "No — the department readiness assessment shows that only two of six departments (Marketing and IT) have High readiness. Implementing ZBB when four departments are at Medium or Low readiness risks significant operational disruption and manager resistance. Apex should defer ZBB for two years and focus on targeted cost reductions within Marketing and IT only.",
